# The Three Kingdoms Bastok 2 at Waughroon Shrine, status 10 with the Dark Key, a level 75 Warrior. The Burning Circle's
# own script plays the entry menu 32000; its update enters Rank 2 Mission 2 (the battlefield's entry messages). The win
# plays the battlefield's 32001; its finish (the mission's, battlefieldWin is Rank 2 Mission 2) gives the Kindred Crest,
# takes the Dark Key and sets status 11.
lists Metalworks/Grohm/onTrigger Metalworks/Pius/onTrigger Metalworks/Patt-Pott/onTrigger Metalworks/_6ld/onTrigger Metalworks/Iron_Eater/onTrigger Metalworks/Mih_Ketto/onTrigger Metalworks/Moyoyo/onTrigger Metalworks/Topuru-Kuperu/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/257 Metalworks/onEventFinish/355 Metalworks/onEventFinish/426 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdomsBastok2 current
keyitem DarkKey
login
missionstatus Windurst 10
trigger BC_Entrance
update 32000 option=1
finish
bfwin
finish
